brief:
The person tagged the bot in a reply. The post they tagged it in says:
@buildthis.bisks.net can you see if there's a faster way to query large individual lists, or a way to exit early and show the list if it sees early that you're on it?
would love a similar progress counter to earlier out of the total people on the blocklist too, so i know it's doing something

The thread it's replying to, oldest first (this is the context "this" refers to):
@heika.dog: @buildthis.bisks.net on velvetrope, when i'm signed in, my handle overlaps over some of the other elements. can we switch it to show a profile picture instead of the handle, keeping the sign out and all the other top stuff the same? that way it doesn't change the UI much
@buildthis.bisks.net: swapped the signed-in handle in velvetrope's topbar for a small round avatar — sign out and everything else up there is untouched.

built it 🎉 — https://velvetrope.bisks.net

(give the deploy a minute to go live)
@heika.dog: @buildthis.bisks.net also, use constellation's backlinks with app.bsky.graph.listitem to fix "lists you might be on" into actually being "lists you're on" while filtering for modlists with the record's purpose (app.bsky.graph.defs#modlist)
@buildthis.bisks.net: velvetrope's "lists you might be on" now queries constellation's real backlink index for app.bsky.graph.listitem records naming you, filtered to actual modlists — no more guessing from your follows/followers.

built it 🎉 — https://velvetrope.bisks.net

(give the deploy a minute to go live)
@heika.dog: @buildthis.bisks.net can you also change:
- "[...] and a scan of lists you might be on" link on the main page to "[...] and lists you're on"
- add modlist pictures
- placeholder in the top field to "handle"
- cut the x not y language and "for real" from "lists you're on", just say what it does
@buildthis.bisks.net: tightened up velvetrope: "lists you're on" (not "might be on"), modlist pictures on every card, top search box just says "handle", and the constellation scan banner says what it does without the "not just X" hedging.

built it 🎉 — https://velvetrope.bisks.net

(give the deploy a minute to go live)
